  "details": "I'd like to have a similar system to discord's \"t\" tags (<t:TIMESTAMP:FORMAT>) for creating absolute and relative date/times in freeform text fields, both in the client and in the website, such as (most importantly) group announcements, but also (why not?) user bios and group/content descriptions. \n\nRight now it's a bit involved to use group announcements to schedule things with people from different timezones, some of which may or may not have DST.",
